# Witness: a block of two unnamed assignments called by a named argument: the argument is not opened, so the block runs (следствие общего алгоритма, журнал 2026-11-18 #call-one-argument-declaration)
# Norm: the book #declaration-selection (its table), #admission; the plan #two-kinds-of-receivers-plan item 1; R65-R68, R71, R76.
# Slice «selection of the declaration by the call» (plan #two-kinds-of-receivers-plan).
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
)
@: shared data[0]

sub: main (C(shared\Observed\seen := shared\Observed\seen + 1; shared\Observed\seen := shared\Observed\seen + 10))
    call(code := C)
main()
